  message: "Done. PR #155 (commit 1819d8bb8). All 4 selection surfaces — sketch._format_symbols, compact.select_by_coverage, compact.select_by_connectivity, format_tiered_behavior_map's post-selection victim removal — now pass rank_symbols' tuned compute_centrality kwargs (hub_threshold=100, within_file_weight=0.3, max_per_file_in=5, edge_type_weights=DEFAULT_EDGE_TYPE_WEIGHTS) via the shared _RANK_CENTRALITY_KWARGS constant in compact.py (sketch reuses inline). Tagged awaits_bakeoff_validation; next DEEP cycle confirms the 50-70% top-100 churn hypothesis is real FP reduction not real-symbol demotion."  # 9470
